# run_ablation.py optional panel cache. The ablation *outputs*
# (ablation_results.csv, ablation_city.csv and their .meta.json) are tracked:
# snapshot_manifest.json hashes them, so a regeneration must show up in
# `git status` instead of being hidden by an ignore rule.
_ablation_panel*.parquet

# Vendored JS deps and slide build output (restored by `npm ci` / `node compile.js`)
node_modules/
slides/output/

# LaTeX structural aux (the PDFs stay tracked on purpose)
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

